{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03902","headline":"则天皇后挽歌二首 一 · 崔融","name":"则天皇后挽歌二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宵陈虚禁夜，夕临空山阴。\n日月昏尺景，天地惨何心。\n紫殿金铺涩，黄陵玉座深。\n镜匳长不啓，圣主泪沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}